<title>ZAMBIA: SOCCER-ZAMBIA AND SOUTH AFRICA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMBIA AND SOUTH AFRICA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of World Cup African zone</p>
<p>group three qualifier on Saturday:</p>
<p>Zambia 0 South Africa 0</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>    Standings     Pl W  D  L  F  A  PTS </p>
<p>South Africa  2  1  1  0  1  0  4</p>
<p>    Congo	   1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p>    Zambia	  2  0  1  1  0  1  1</p>
